      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 63352,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 837832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Streams are typed message streams. Each entry is\nmodifiable and retains its previous states. Every stream\ncites the entry that created it.\n\nORIGIN STREAM\nOpens with the first message of a conversation. Exactly one\nper conversation.\n\nMAJOR STREAM\nA child of the origin stream, created by the first Split.\nOne per top-level thought.\n\nTOT STREAM\nForms inside a major stream, created by any later Split.\nTight-scoped, one line of thought.\n\nNote: as written, Major and TOT differ only by depth, not\nby kind. See open question 1.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "e0007",
      "originalText": "Streams are typed message streams. Each entry is\nmodifiable and retains its previous states. Every stream\ncites the entry that created it.\n\nORIGIN STREAM\nOpens with the first message of a conversation. Exactly one\nper conversation.\n\nMAJOR STREAM\nA child of the origin stream, created by the first Split.\nOne per top-level thought.\n\nTOT STREAM\nForms inside a major stream, created by any later Split.\nTight-scoped, one line of thought.\n\nNote: as written, Major and TOT differ only by depth, not\nby kind. See open question 1.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e0009",
