      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Takes recalled info as an INPUT. It does not fetch it;\nthe caller runs Recall first.\nGiven the claim and the recalled info, use dispatchable\ntools to falsify or substantiate the claim.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "e0043",
      "originalText": "Takes recalled info as an INPUT. It does not fetch it;\nthe caller runs Recall first.\nGiven the claim and the recalled info, use dispatchable\ntools to falsify or substantiate the claim.",
