      "text": "EVIDENTIAL SUFFICIENCY\nDid the tools reach the claim at all? A tool that could\nnot address the claim is no evidence, not weak evidence.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "e0046",
      "originalText": "EVIDENTIAL SUFFICIENCY\nDid the tools reach the claim at all? A tool that could\nnot address the claim is no evidence, not weak evidence.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
